---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';
import refs from '../../../../../public/equipment/12-06/references.json';
import verified from '../../../../../public/equipment/12-06/verification.json';
const a='/equipment/12-06/';
---
<Layout pageTitle="ZEISS LSM 980 NLO" subtitle="" description="Inspect a dormant upright system and measure the XY and XZ sections of an inert digital reference block." wide={true}>
<article class="equipment zn1206">
<nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/12-06/">← Equipment 12-06</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Equipment register</a><a href="#evidence">References & checks</a></nav>
<header class="eq-mast"><span class="eq-meta">12-06 / Dormant upright exhibit and passive stack viewer</span><h2>ZEISS LSM 980 NLO · Upright stack viewer</h2><p>Inspect the Axio Examiner.Z1 layout, then compare XY and XZ sections of an inert digital test block. It has the same width in both views but a different extent along Y and Z.</p></header>
<div class="zn-grid">
<section class="zn-card"><h3>Documentary NLO layout</h3><div class="zn-bar"><button data-view="whole">Whole rig</button><button data-view="stand">Upright optics</button><button data-view="scanner">Scan housing</button><button data-view="desk">Workstation</button><button id="camera-reset">Reset camera</button></div>
<div class="zn-camera"><canvas id="nlo-model" aria-label="Dormant ZEISS upright stand with LSM 980 scanner housing, table, and separate stack playback monitor"></canvas></div>
<p id="asset" class="zn-note" role="status">Loading metre-scale GLB…</p><p class="zn-note">Drag or pinch. The 3D screen switches the selected section plane, and its separate desk key measures the current slice. Instrument controls are inactive. This is not the separate 12-03 Airyscan profile.</p></section>
<section class="zn-card"><h3>Read-only inert stack</h3>
<div class="zn-bar"><button id="xy" aria-pressed="true">XY section</button><button id="xz" aria-pressed="false">XZ section</button><button id="center">Center reference</button></div>
<div class="zn-bar"><label id="axis-label">Section index <input id="slice" type="range" min="0" max="20" step="1" value="7" /></label><output id="slice-value">Z = 35 µm</output><label>Display contrast <select id="contrast"><option value="normal">Standard</option><option value="high">High</option></select></label></div>
<div class="zn-frame"><canvas id="raster" width="64" height="48" aria-label="Synthetic inert stack section with physical voxel aspect ratio"></canvas></div>
<p id="axes" class="zn-note">2 µm horizontal and 2 µm vertical per voxel.</p>
<div class="zn-bar"><button id="measure" class="primary">Measure bright inset</button><button id="reset">Reset example</button></div>
<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">XY at Z=35 µm. Measure the bright inset.</p>
<div class="zn-bar"><button id="export-json">Export section JSON</button><button id="export-png">Download section PNG</button><a href={a+'example-section.json'}>Example result</a></div>
</section>
</div>
<section id="evidence"><h3>Documentation and independent checks</h3>
<figure class="zn-fig"><img src={a+'reference-layout.svg'} alt="Original documentary elevation of the ZEISS upright stand and scan housing beside the two inert digital sections" loading="lazy"/><figcaption>Original reference elevation. The documentary shell does not reproduce an installed optical path.</figcaption></figure>
<ul>{refs.refs.map(r=><li><a href={r.url}>{r.title}</a>. {r.caption}</li>)}</ul>
<p>Metric hardware anchors: <b>450 × 220 × 550 mm</b> scan housing and <b>1800 × 910 × 1500 mm</b> system table, W × H × D. Exact stand accessory dimensions and workstation arrangement are not known and are estimated. The NLO housing is shown closed and unconnected; optical acquisition, excitation, and physical calibration are not implemented, so the register’s quadratic-response acceptance does not apply here.</p>
<p>The input is a fixed digital 64 × 48 × 21 voxel stack sampled at 2 × 2 × 5 µm, whose center coordinates are the zero-based indices times physical sample spacing. XY fixes Z; XZ fixes Y. Voxels with intensity ≥ 185 mark the bright test cuboid; measurements use occupied voxel edges and ignore the display contrast control. The PNG retains native voxels with the selected display contrast; JSON records raw intensities, physical axis spacings, index, source ID and measured bounds. There is no biological or acquired image content.</p>
<div class="zn-table"><table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th><th>Tolerance</th><th>Result</th></tr></thead><tbody>{verified.checks.map(c=><tr><th>{c.id}</th><td>{String(c.expected)} {c.unit}</td><td>{typeof c.actual==='number'?Number(c.actual.toFixed(8)):String(c.actual)} {c.unit}</td><td>{c.tolerance===0?'Exact':c.tolerance}</td><td>{c.pass?'Pass':'Fail'}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div>
<p><a href={a+'build-model.py'} download>Editable model source</a> · <a href={a+'lsm980-nlo-display.glb'} download>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={a+'references.json'}>Reference notes</a> · <a href={a+'vr-station.json'}>VR interaction manifest</a> · <a href={a+'stack.mjs'}>Independent stack logic</a> · <a href={a+'verification.json'}>Verification JSON</a>. No immersive headset session tested.</p></section>
</article></Layout><script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/12-06/client.mjs';</script>
<style>
.zn1206{--zn-rule:color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 27%,transparent);max-width:1280px;margin:auto}.zn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.08fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}.zn-card{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--zn-rule);padding:.85rem;margin:.8rem 0}.zn-card h3{margin:.21rem 0 .6rem}
.zn-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.45rem;margin:.53rem 0}.zn-bar,.zn-note,.zn-fig figcaption{font:.86rem/1.4 system-ui,sans-serif}.zn1206 :is(button,input,select){font:inherit;accent-color:#426d60}.zn1206 :is(button,select){padding:.39rem;background:var(--panel,Canvas);color:inherit;border:1px solid var(--zn-rule);border-radius:3px;min-height:36px;cursor:pointer}.zn1206 :is(.primary,button[aria-pressed=true]){background:#34594f;color:#fff}
.zn-camera{aspect-ratio:1.42;background:#273c43}.zn-camera canvas{width:100%;height:100%;display:block;touch-action:none}.zn-frame{max-width:500px}.zn-frame canvas{width:100%;height:auto;display:block;image-rendering:pixelated;background:#233640}
.zn-table{overflow:auto}.zn-table table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.zn-table :is(td,th){border-bottom:1px solid var(--zn-rule);padding:.44rem;text-align:left}.zn-fig{margin:1rem 0;max-width:620px}.zn-fig img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.zn-fig figcaption{margin:.38rem 0}
@media(max-width:840px){.zn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
